  "published": "2026-06-11T08:54:25.723Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixed create to send vals_list as a list of value dictionaries per the JSON-2 API\n            contract, instead of a single dictionary.\n            Added batch CreateManyAsync for creating multiple records in a single call,\n            returning the created ids in order.\n            Enforced field readability in Fields(...): selecting a field marked Read = false now\n            throws instead of producing an unmapped or invalid request.\n            Added client-side validation for record ids, Limit/Offset, context keys, and\n            OdooModel/OdooField names.\n            Made UserAgent optional with a default of OdooSharp.\n            Renamed OdooJsonRequestFactory to OdooRequestFactory and made the HTTP transport\n            types internal.",
